@startuml
!include _style.puml

|#EFF6FF|Learner|
start
:1. Select Lesson in Learning Path;
:2. Open Lesson Content Viewer;
:3. Review Vocabulary & Grammar Theory;
:4. Start Exercise Session;

repeat
  :5. Answer Current Exercise;
  |#FFFFFF|System|
  :6. Evaluate Answer Deterministically;
  if (Answer Correct?) then (yes)
    :7. Award 100% Full Credit;
  else (no)
    if (Retry Allowance Available?\nmax(1, floor(N * 0.10))) then (yes)
      |#EFF6FF|Learner|
      :8. Retry Same Incorrect Question;
      |#FFFFFF|System|
      :9. Re-evaluate (Capped at 70% Credit);
    else (no)
      :10. Log Zero Credit for Question;
    endif
  endif
repeat while (More Exercises Remaining in Lesson?) is (yes)
->no;

:11. Calculate Final Lesson Score & Pass Threshold;
:12. Update UserProgress to COMPLETED;
:13. Update Streak & Trigger SRS Interval (1/3/7/14/30);
|#EFF6FF|Learner|
:14. View Completion Summary & Next Step;
stop
@enduml
